[
  {
    "beat_id": 1,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "吱——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "雨是子时三刻落下来的。\n陆九没抬头。城隍庙的漏雨他数过——三十二年，六千四百八十六场雨，每一场从哪片瓦开始滴，他都记得。唯独这一场，开头就不对。雨点砸在供桌上，"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 2,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "此卦——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他的左眼是瞎的。二十三岁那年替师妹算了一卦，把师妹的命格算进了自己命里，从此左眼就废了——赔给她了。右眼是这世上他唯一能看世界的地方。但这一刻，他的右眼在发烫。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 3,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "卦盘不出血。右眼开始疼。\n这两件事，从他出师门到现在，没同时发生过。\n他把摊子上那只破碗收进袖里，准备今夜收摊。庙门外，雨帘里站着一个人。\n那人撑一把红伞。伞面"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 4,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "九哥哥。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "师妹当年——\n陆九的右眼猝然涌出一阵刺痛，紧跟着视野里蹦出了白麻孝服的一角。\n孝服只在他记忆里出现过一次。二十四年前那场火，师妹被天机阁的人从火场里拖出来时，身"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 5,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "九哥哥，别算。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "声音是从他身体里传出来的。不是红伞下那女子——那女子还没开口。\n\"九哥哥，别算。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 6,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "算不到",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他的手指在龟壳上停住了。\n卦盘不出血。是因为他算不到自己——从二十四年前开始，他就再也没有算准过关于自己、关于师妹的任何卦。但这一刻的\"算不到\"，比任何一次都更"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 7,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九低下头。他看见自己袖口上的血迹正在扩大。从手腕往上，像一条极细的蛇在爬。\n庙门外那把红伞往前移了三步。\n伞面破角滴下来的水，在泥地上汇成一个字。陆九的右眼剧"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 8,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "陆先生。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他的姓。\n\"陆先生。\"红伞下那人终于开口了。声音清冷，像是把一块冰含在嘴里说话，\"天机阁白十二，请陆先生回临安分舵一叙。\"\n陆九没抬头。他知道\"白十二\"是谁。天"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 9,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "陆先生算不到很多人。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他没骗人。\n白无垢笑了。笑声从伞下传出来，带着木屐点地的三下响声——嗒、嗒、嗒。\n\"陆先生算不到很多人。\"白无垢说，\"但陆先生今晚要算到自己——三日后头顶发绿。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 10,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "咯吱、咯吱",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的右眼在这一刻停了。\n不是不痛了。是**看见**了。\n他看见红伞下那人的右手。右手藏在玄色袖里，袖口用金线绣着三道算筹纹——是天机阁阁主的标记。但那只手不是"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 11,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "九哥哥，他来了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "庙门外，雨声忽然停了。\n陆九的右眼又看见了白麻孝服。\n这次不是一角。是整件。师妹站在他身后三步远的位置，赤足，右脚踝上系着的那根红绳——是他二十三岁那年给她系上"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 12,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "白阁主。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九没回头。\n他知道自己回头会看见什么。他这三十六年只回头看过一次——那一次他瞎了左眼。他不敢再回头看第二眼。\n\"白阁主。\" 陆九说，\"三日后我头顶发绿。这一卦"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 13,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "陆先生。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白无垢的笑意终于没了。\n\"陆先生。\" 他的声音沉下去，\"天机阁要找的东西，在不在陆先生手里，今晚就要见分晓。\"\n\"白阁主找什么？\"\n\"找——\" 白无垢的右手从袖"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 14,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "白阁主要找的不是神女。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九低头看自己的龟壳。\n龟壳上那七道裂纹里，正在渗出极细的一丝血。\n他算到了。\n\"白阁主要找的不是神女。\" 陆九说。\n\"哦？\"\n\"白阁主找的是——能算出神女下落"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 15,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "但我能算到另一件事。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白无垢的右手停住了。\n\"但我能算到另一件事。\" 陆九说，\"我能算到——三日后谁会死。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 16,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我算我自己三日后头顶发绿。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "庙门外的风在这一刻转向了。从西北转到东南——死门的方向。\n\"我算我自己三日后头顶发绿。\" 陆九说，\"我算白阁主三日后——\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 17,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "陆先生的右眼——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他没说完。\n他什么都看不见了。黑的。彻底的。\n他听见白无垢的笑声。\n\"陆先生的右眼——\" 白无垢说，\"替人守了二十四年的孝，今日**到期**了。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 18,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*走了出去",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的龟壳从腰间掉下来。\n掉在泥地上。裂纹里渗出的血，正在一点一点——**消失**。\n像是有什么东西，从裂纹里**走了出去**。\n陆九跪下去。\n他的双手在泥里摸"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 19,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你终于看不见了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "声音从他自己身体里传来。极轻的。极近的。像是师妹贴着他的右耳，在叫他的名字。\n\"你终于看不见了。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 20,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*别回头。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的双手停在龟壳上。\n他这一辈子，从来没听师妹用这种语气说话过。\n\"九哥哥。\" 声音又说，\"**别回头。**\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 21,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "陆先生，三日后，临安分舵。届时——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "庙门外的红伞往后退了三步。\n白无垢的声音从雨里传来：\"陆先生，三日后，临安分舵。届时——\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 22,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*他跪着的膝盖下的泥",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他的声音顿住了。\n陆九的龟壳没等他的手按住，就自己迸开了第八道纹。\n新裂开的纹路，从\"头顶发绿\"那一爻开始，斜斜地往下——直指**他跪着的膝盖下的泥**。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 23,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*红绳。*",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "泥里有东西。\n陆九把双手伸进泥里。\n摸到的不是泥。是一根极细的、已经褪成粉色的——\n**红绳。**\n他二十三岁给师妹系上的那根。\n它怎么会在这里。\n陆九的右眼—"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 24,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*他瞎了二十四年的左眼，在这一刻，能流泪了。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他的命格——他的命格正在**开花**。而那朵花，是师妹种在他命格里的，二十四年前。\n他跪在泥里，双手捧着那根褪色的红绳，忽然笑了。\n他笑了很久。\n笑到庙门外的雨"
  }
]